<h1>Text Analyzer</h1>
<p>
    Type or Paste letters and click submit to analyze the text.
    The analyzer will display the count per letter and its percentage in the text.
    Numbers, special characters, whitespaces are ignored.
</p>

<textarea id="text-input"></textarea><br>
<button id="submit-btn" disabled>Analyze</button>
<div id="status"></div>
<div id="results"></div>
